weaknesses.value:
The paper could benefit from a deeper theoretical analysis of why the proposed method works and its limitations;

Additional experiments on a wider range of datasets and scenes would strengthen the evidence for the method’s generalizability and robustness;

The description of the linear transformation process and the role of text captions need more detail to fully understand the approach.

